<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>krafen / watchlist</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Список аниме, фильмов и сериалов — krafen">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/krafenx/krafen/8c5ff5d6ae7d406899fbf4906d5bc543e06c6648/cherry-blossom.png">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* ─── VARIABLES (same as index.html) ─── */
        :root {
            --bg: #050505;
            --card: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.6);
            --accent: #5b2333;
            --accent-light: #f7f4f3;
            --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--accent-dark, #5b2333));
            --accent-soft: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(247,244,243,0.12), rgba(91,35,51,0.28));
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; }
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            color: #efefef;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        body > .max-w-6xl {
            width: calc(100vw - 3rem);
            max-width: 72rem;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            body > .max-w-6xl { width: calc(100vw - 6rem); }
        }

        /* ─── GLASS (same as index.html) ─── */
        .glass {
            background: var(--card);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .glass:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(91,35,51,0.25);
        }

        /* ─── TAILWIND ACCENT REMAPPING (same as index.html) ─── */
        .bg-blue-500, .animate-pulse.bg-blue-500 { background: var(--accent-gradient) !important; }
        .bg-blue-500\/10 { background: var(--accent-soft) !important; }
        .hover\:bg-blue-500\/20:hover { background: linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(247,244,243,.18),rgba(91,35,51,.38)) !important; }
        .text-blue-300, .text-blue-400, .text-blue-500 {
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent !important;
        }
        .border-blue-500\/30, .hover\:border-blue-500\/30:hover, .hover\:border-blue-500:hover {
            border-color: rgba(91,35,51,0.7) !important;
        }

        /* ─── ADMIN MODE ─── */
        /* Elements only visible in admin mode */
        .admin-only { display: none !important; }
        body.is-admin .admin-only { display: flex !important; }
        body.is-admin .admin-only-block { display: block !important; }
        /* Admin mode banner */
        #admin-bar {
            display: none;
            align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            background: var(--accent-soft);
            border: 1px solid rgba(91,35,51,0.4);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        }
        body.is-admin #admin-bar { display: flex; }

        /* ─── FILTER PILLS ─── */
        .filter-btn {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 9999px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            background: transparent; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .filter-btn:hover { border-color: rgba(91,35,51,0.5); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); }
        .filter-btn.active { background: var(--accent-soft); border-color: rgba(91,35,51,0.7); color: var(--accent-light); }

        /* ─── CARDS GRID ─── */
        .cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(148px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) { .cards-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

        /* ─── MEDIA CARD ─── */
        .media-card {
            background: var(--card); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 1rem;
            overflow: hidden; transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .media-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(91,35,51,0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* ─── POSTER ─── */
        .poster-wrap {
            position: relative; aspect-ratio: 2/3; overflow: hidden;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        }
        .poster-wrap img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; transition: transform 0.4s ease; }
        .media-card:hover .poster-wrap img { transform: scale(1.04); }
        .no-poster {
            width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
            font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.15em; opacity:0.22;
        }

        /* ─── ADMIN HOVER OVERLAY (only shown in admin mode) ─── */
        .card-overlay {
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(5,5,5,0.9);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            gap: 5px; padding: 0.75rem;
            opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        /* Only show overlay on hover IN ADMIN MODE */
        body.is-admin .media-card:hover .card-overlay {
            opacity: 1; pointer-events: all;
        }
        .ov-btn {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 8.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            width: 100%; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 9999px; border: 1px solid;
            background: transparent; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s ease; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .ov-watched { color: #22c55e; border-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.4); }
        .ov-watched:hover { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.15); }
        .ov-planned { color: var(--accent-light); border-color: rgba(247,244,243,0.22); }
        .ov-planned:hover { background: rgba(247,244,243,0.07); }
        .ov-dropped { color: #ef4444; border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); }
        .ov-dropped:hover { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15); }
        .ov-remove { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.22); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); margin-top:3px; }
        .ov-remove:hover { color: #ef4444; border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1); }

        /* ─── CARD INFO ─── */
        .card-info { padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem 0.7rem; }
        .card-title {
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #efefef;
            line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 4px;
            display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .card-meta { display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:5px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
        .meta-year { font-size:9px; opacity:0.35; }
        .meta-type {
            font-size:7.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.1em;
            padding:1px 6px; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); opacity:0.45;
        }
        .status-badge {
            font-size:7.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.1em;
            padding:2px 8px; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid; display:inline-block;
        }
        .status-watched { color:#22c55e; border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.35); }
        .status-planned { color:var(--accent-light); border-color:rgba(247,244,243,0.22); }
        .status-dropped { color:#ef4444; border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.35); }

        /* ─── MODAL BASE ─── */
        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(5,5,5,0.82); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 100; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }
        .modal-overlay.open { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
        .modal-box {
            background: rgba(12,12,12,0.99);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 1.5rem;
            width: 100%; max-width: 520px; max-height: 84vh;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;
            transform: scale(0.96) translateY(12px); transition: transform 0.22s ease;
        }
        .modal-overlay.open .modal-box { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
        .modal-header {
            padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .modal-body { overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; }
        .modal-close {
            background: none; border: none; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 16px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            padding: 0; line-height: 1; margin-top: 2px; transition: color 0.15s ease; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .modal-close:hover { color: #efefef; }

        /* ─── INPUTS ─── */
        .kf-input {
            width: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09); border-radius: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px; color: #efefef; outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
        }
        .kf-input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
        .kf-input:focus { border-color: rgba(91,35,51,0.65); }

        /* ─── SEARCH RESULTS ─── */
        .search-result {
            display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; align-items: center;
            padding: 0.6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }
        .search-result:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .result-poster {
            width: 38px; height: 57px; flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }
        .result-poster img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
        .result-no-poster {
            width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center;
            justify-content:center; font-size:7px; opacity:0.25;
        }
        .result-info { flex:1; min-width:0; }
        .result-title { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.3; margin-bottom:2px; color:#efefef; }
        .result-orig  { font-size:9px; opacity:0.35; margin-bottom:1px; }
        .result-year  { font-size:9px; opacity:0.35; }
        .result-actions { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px; flex-shrink:0; }
        .add-btn {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 7.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 9999px; border: 1px solid;
            background: transparent; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; transition: all 0.15s ease;
        }
        .add-watched { color:#22c55e; border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.38); }
        .add-watched:hover { background:rgba(34,197,94,0.14); }
        .add-planned { color:var(--accent-light); border-color:rgba(247,244,243,0.18); }
        .add-planned:hover { background:rgba(247,244,243,0.06); }
        .add-dropped { color:#ef4444; border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.38); }
        .add-dropped:hover { background:rgba(239,68,68,0.14); }

        /* ─── ALERTS ─── */
        .warn-box {
            font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5;
            background: rgba(239,68,68,0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.18);
            border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            color: rgba(239,68,68,0.75); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .warn-box a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }
        .info-box {
            font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5;
            background: rgba(91,35,51,0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(91,35,51,0.3);
            border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            color: rgba(247,244,243,0.6); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .info-box a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }

        /* ─── LOADING / SPINNER ─── */
        .spinner {
            width: 18px; height: 18px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-top-color: var(--accent-light);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 0.7s linear infinite;
            margin: 1.25rem auto;
        }
        @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

        /* ─── SKELETON CARDS ─── */
        .skeleton-card {
            background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .skeleton-poster { aspect-ratio: 2/3; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
        .skeleton-info { padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem 0.75rem; }
        .skeleton-line {
            height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), rgba(255,255,255,0.07), rgba(255,255,255,0.04));
            background-size: 200% 100%; animation: shimmer 1.8s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shimmer { 0%{background-position:-200% 0} 100%{background-position:200% 0} }

        /* ─── EMPTY STATE ─── */
        .empty-state { text-align:center; padding:5rem 2rem; }
        .empty-icon { font-size:2.5rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
        .empty-text { font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.18em; opacity:0.28; }

        /* ─── LOCK BUTTON ─── */
        #lock-btn {
            position: fixed; bottom: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; z-index: 50;
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.25; transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        #lock-btn:hover { opacity: 0.7; border-color: rgba(91,35,51,0.5); background: rgba(91,35,51,0.12); }
        body.is-admin #lock-btn { opacity: 0.6; border-color: rgba(91,35,51,0.5); }

        /* ─── TOAST ─── */
        .toast {
            position: fixed; bottom: 1.5rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(16px);
            background: rgba(12,12,12,0.97); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
            white-space: nowrap; pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0; transition: all 0.25s ease; z-index: 200;
        }
        .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

        /* ─── SCROLLBAR ─── */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(91,35,51,0.4); border-radius: 2px; }

        /* ─── SAVE INDICATOR ─── */
        #save-indicator {
            font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease; color: #22c55e;
        }
        #save-indicator.saving { opacity: 0.7; color: var(--accent-light); }
        #save-indicator.saved  { opacity: 0.7; color: #22c55e; }
        #save-indicator.error  { opacity: 0.7; color: #ef4444; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="p-6 md:p-12">

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

        <!-- ─── HEADER ─── -->
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-8">
            <div>
                <a href="index.html" class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] opacity-25 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">← home</a>
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white mt-2">watchlist</h1>
                <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] opacity-30 mt-1">аниме · фильмы · сериалы</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2 mt-7">
                <button id="add-btn"
                    class="admin-only flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full
                           bg-blue-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-300
                           border border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-all">
                    + добавить
                </button>
                <span id="save-indicator">—</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ─── ADMIN BAR ─── -->
        <div id="admin-bar">
            <span style="color:var(--accent-light);opacity:0.7;">⚡ admin mode</span>
            <button onclick="adminLogout()"
                class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] opacity-40 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-white">
                выйти
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- ─── STATS ─── -->
        <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-6" id="stats-row"></div>

        <!-- ─── SETUP WARNING (shown if bin not configured) ─── -->
        <div id="setup-warn" class="warn-box hidden">
            ⚠ JSONBin не настроен. Смотри инструкцию в конце файла watchlist.html
        </div>

        <!-- ─── FILTERS ─── -->
        <div class="glass p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
                    <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-35 w-11 flex-shrink-0">Тип</span>
                    <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap" id="type-filters">
                        <button class="filter-btn active" data-type="all">Все</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-type="anime">Аниме</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-type="movie">Фильмы</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-type="series">Сериалы</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
                    <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-35 w-11 flex-shrink-0">Статус</span>
                    <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap" id="status-filters">
                        <button class="filter-btn active" data-status="all">Все</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-status="watched">Просмотрено</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-status="planned">Планирую</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-status="dropped">Брошено</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ─── LOADING ─── -->
        <div id="loading-state" class="cards-grid">
            ${[...Array(8)].map(() => `
            <div class="skeleton-card">
                <div class="skeleton-poster shimmer"></div>
                <div class="skeleton-info">
                    <div class="skeleton-line mb-2" style="width:85%"></div>
                    <div class="skeleton-line" style="width:55%"></div>
                </div>
            </div>`).join('')}
        </div>

        <!-- ─── CARD GRID ─── -->
        <div id="cards-grid" class="cards-grid hidden"></div>

        <!-- ─── EMPTY STATE ─── -->
        <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state hidden">
            <div class="empty-icon">🌸</div>
            <p class="empty-text">список пуст</p>
            <p class="empty-text mt-2" style="opacity:0.18;" id="empty-hint">загрузка...</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── LOCK BUTTON ─── -->
    <button id="lock-btn" title="admin" onclick="openAdminModal()">🔒</button>

    <!-- ─── MODAL: ADD MEDIA ─── -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-add">
        <div class="modal-box">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] opacity-30 mb-2">добавить в список</div>
                    <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap" id="modal-type-btns">
                        <button class="filter-btn active" data-modal-type="movie">Фильм</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-modal-type="series">Сериал</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn" data-modal-type="anime">Аниме</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('modal-add')">✕</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div id="omdb-warn" class="warn-box hidden">
                    OMDB ключ не настроен — поиск фильмов/сериалов недоступен.
                    Аниме работает. Ключ: <a href="https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx" target="_blank">omdbapi.com</a> → CONFIG.omdb_api_key
                </div>
                <input type="text" id="search-input" class="kf-input mb-4"
                       placeholder="начни вводить название..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
                <div id="search-results"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── MODAL: ADMIN LOGIN ─── -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-admin">
        <div class="modal-box" style="max-width:400px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] opacity-30 mb-1">admin panel</div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Вход</div>
                </div>
                <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('modal-admin')">✕</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="info-box mb-4">
                    Введи JSONBin Master Key чтобы войти в режим редактирования.
                    Ключ хранится только в памяти сессии и нигде не сохраняется.
                </div>
                <div class="relative mb-3">
                    <input type="password" id="admin-key-input" class="kf-input"
                           placeholder="$2b$10$... (master key)" autocomplete="off"
                           onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter') submitAdminLogin()">
                </div>
                <div id="admin-login-error" class="text-[10px] text-red-400 mb-3 hidden">
                    Неверный ключ или ошибка соединения
                </div>
                <button onclick="submitAdminLogin()"
                    id="login-btn"
                    class="w-full rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30
                           text-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-500/20 text-[10px] uppercase
                           tracking-[0.18em] py-2 transition-all cursor-pointer
                           font-['JetBrains_Mono']">
                    войти
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── TOAST ─── -->
    <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

    <script>
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        //  CONFIG
        //  Инструкция по настройке — в самом конце файла (в комментарии)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        const CONFIG = {
            // 1. Зарегистрируйся на https://jsonbin.io
            //    Создай бин (+ New Bin), содержимое = [] , сделай публичным (Private = OFF)
            //    Скопируй Bin ID из адресной строки
            jsonbin_bin_id: '69f0765136566621a8fe678c',

            // 2. В личном кабинете JSONBin → API Keys → скопируй Master Key
            //    Он НЕ хранится в HTML — вводится только в форме входа каждую сессию
            //    (можно оставить пустым здесь, он спрашивается при логине)

            // 3. Бесплатный OMDB ключ: https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx
            //    Нужен только для поиска фильмов и сериалов (аниме работает без него)
            omdb_api_key: 'YOUR_OMDB_KEY',
        };

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  CONSTANTS
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        const API_BASE       = 'https://api.jsonbin.io/v3/b';
        const STATUS_LABEL   = { watched: 'Просмотрено', planned: 'Планирую', dropped: 'Брошено' };
        const STATUS_COLORS  = { watched: '#22c55e', planned: '#f7f4f3', dropped: '#ef4444' };
        const TYPE_LABEL     = { movie: 'фильм', series: 'сериал', anime: 'аниме' };

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  STATE
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        let list          = [];
        let typeFilter    = 'all';
        let statusFilter  = 'all';
        let modalType     = 'movie';
        let searchTimeout = null;
        let searchCache   = [];
        let isSaving      = false;

        function getMasterKey() { return sessionStorage.getItem('wl_admin_key') || ''; }
        function isAdmin()      { return !!getMasterKey(); }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  JSONBIN API
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        async function fetchList() {
            if (!CONFIG.jsonbin_bin_id || CONFIG.jsonbin_bin_id === 'YOUR_BIN_ID') {
                document.getElementById('setup-warn').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('loading-state').classList.add('hidden');
                document.getElementById('empty-state').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('empty-hint').textContent = 'настрой JSONBin в файле';
                render();
                return;
            }
            try {
                const res  = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/${CONFIG.jsonbin_bin_id}/latest`);
                if (!res.ok) throw new Error('fetch_failed');
                const data = await res.json();
                list = Array.isArray(data.record) ? data.record : [];
            } catch (e) {
                list = [];
                showToast('⚠ Не удалось загрузить список', '#ef4444');
            }
            document.getElementById('loading-state').classList.add('hidden');
            document.getElementById('cards-grid').classList.remove('hidden');
            render();
        }

        async function saveToCloud() {
            const key = getMasterKey();
            if (!key) return;
            setSaveIndicator('saving', 'сохранение...');
            isSaving = true;
            try {
                const res = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/${CONFIG.jsonbin_bin_id}`, {
                    method: 'PUT',
                    headers: {
                        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
                        'X-Master-Key': key,
                    },
                    body: JSON.stringify(list),
                });
                if (!res.ok) throw new Error('save_failed');
                setSaveIndicator('saved', 'сохранено ✓');
                setTimeout(() => setSaveIndicator('', ''), 2000);
            } catch {
                setSaveIndicator('error', 'ошибка сохранения');
                setTimeout(() => setSaveIndicator('', ''), 3000);
            }
            isSaving = false;
        }

        function setSaveIndicator(cls, text) {
            const el = document.getElementById('save-indicator');
            el.className = cls;
            el.textContent = text;
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  ADMIN AUTH
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        function openAdminModal() {
            if (isAdmin()) {
                // Already logged in — confirm logout
                if (confirm('Выйти из режима администратора?')) adminLogout();
                return;
            }
            openModal('modal-admin');
            setTimeout(() => document.getElementById('admin-key-input').focus(), 120);
        }

        async function submitAdminLogin() {
            const key    = document.getElementById('admin-key-input').value.trim();
            const btn    = document.getElementById('login-btn');
            const errEl  = document.getElementById('admin-login-error');
            if (!key) return;

            btn.textContent = 'проверка...';
            btn.disabled    = true;
            errEl.classList.add('hidden');

            // Validate key by attempting to read the bin with it
            try {
                const res = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/${CONFIG.jsonbin_bin_id}/latest`, {
                    headers: { 'X-Master-Key': key }
                });
                if (!res.ok) throw new Error('invalid_key');

                // Valid — store in session only
                sessionStorage.setItem('wl_admin_key', key);
                setAdminMode(true);
                closeModal('modal-admin');
                document.getElementById('admin-key-input').value = '';
                showToast('⚡ Admin mode активен', '#f7f4f3');
            } catch {
                errEl.classList.remove('hidden');
            }

            btn.textContent = 'войти';
            btn.disabled    = false;
        }

        function adminLogout() {
            sessionStorage.removeItem('wl_admin_key');
            setAdminMode(false);
            showToast('Вышел из admin mode', 'rgba(255,255,255,0.4)');
        }

        function setAdminMode(on) {
            document.body.classList.toggle('is-admin', on);
            document.getElementById('lock-btn').title = on ? 'выйти из admin' : 'admin';
            document.getElementById('lock-btn').textContent = on ? '🔓' : '🔒';
            if (!on) setSaveIndicator('', '');
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  DATA MUTATIONS (admin only)
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        function addItem(item, status) {
            if (!isAdmin()) return;
            const existing = list.find(i => i.id === item.id);
            if (existing) {
                existing.status = status;
            } else {
                list.unshift({ ...item, status, addedAt: Date.now() });
            }
            render();
            saveToCloud();
            showToast(`${item.titleRu || item.title} → ${STATUS_LABEL[status]}`, STATUS_COLORS[status]);
        }

        function removeItem(id) {
            if (!isAdmin()) return;
            list = list.filter(i => i.id !== id);
            render();
            saveToCloud();
        }

        function changeStatus(id, status) {
            if (!isAdmin()) return;
            const item = list.find(i => i.id === id);
            if (!item) return;
            item.status = status;
            render();
            saveToCloud();
            showToast(`${item.titleRu || item.title} → ${STATUS_LABEL[status]}`, STATUS_COLORS[status]);
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  API SEARCH
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        async function searchOMDB(query, type) {
            if (!CONFIG.omdb_api_key || CONFIG.omdb_api_key === 'YOUR_OMDB_KEY') return { error: 'no_key' };
            try {
                const res  = await fetch(`https://www.omdbapi.com/?s=${encodeURIComponent(query)}&type=${type}&apikey=${CONFIG.omdb_api_key}`);
                const data = await res.json();
                if (data.Response === 'False') return { results: [] };
                return {
                    results: (data.Search || []).slice(0, 8).map(i => ({
                        id: i.imdbID, title: i.Title,
                        year: (i.Year || '').slice(0, 4) || '—',
                        type: i.Type === 'series' ? 'series' : 'movie',
                        poster: (i.Poster && i.Poster !== 'N/A') ? i.Poster : null,
                    }))
                };
            } catch { return { error: 'fetch_error' }; }
        }

        async function searchShikimori(query) {
            try {
                const res  = await fetch(
                    `https://shikimori.one/api/animes?search=${encodeURIComponent(query)}&limit=10&order=popularity`,
                    { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'krafen-watchlist' } }
                );
                if (!res.ok) throw new Error();
                const data = await res.json();
                return {
                    results: data.map(i => ({
                        id: `sh_${i.id}`, title: i.name, titleRu: i.russian || null,
                        year: i.aired_on ? i.aired_on.slice(0, 4) : '—', type: 'anime',
                        poster: i.image?.original ? `https://shikimori.one${i.image.original}` : null,
                    }))
                };
            } catch { return { error: 'fetch_error' }; }
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  HELPERS
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        function escapeHTML(str) {
            return String(str ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, c =>
                ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c])
            );
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  RENDER
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        function render() {
            updateStats();
            const filtered = list.filter(i => {
                if (typeFilter   !== 'all' && i.type   !== typeFilter)   return false;
                if (statusFilter !== 'all' && i.status !== statusFilter) return false;
                return true;
            });

            const grid  = document.getElementById('cards-grid');
            const empty = document.getElementById('empty-state');

            if (filtered.length === 0) {
                grid.innerHTML = '';
                empty.classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('empty-hint').textContent =
                    isAdmin() ? 'нажми + добавить' : 'скоро появится что-нибудь интересное';
                return;
            }
            empty.classList.add('hidden');
            grid.innerHTML = filtered.map(cardHTML).join('');
        }

        function cardHTML(item) {
            const title  = escapeHTML(item.titleRu || item.title);
            const id     = escapeHTML(item.id);
            const typeL  = escapeHTML(TYPE_LABEL[item.type]  || item.type);
            const statL  = escapeHTML(STATUS_LABEL[item.status] || item.status);
            return `
            <div class="media-card">
                <div class="poster-wrap">
                    ${item.poster
                        ? `<img src="${escapeHTML(item.poster)}" alt="${title}" loading="lazy"
                               onerror="this.parentNode.innerHTML='<div class=\\"no-poster\\">${typeL}</div>'">`
                        : `<div class="no-poster">${typeL}</div>`
                    }
                    <div class="card-overlay">
                        <button class="ov-btn ov-watched" onclick="changeStatus('${id}','watched')">✓ Просмотрено</button>
                        <button class="ov-btn ov-planned" onclick="changeStatus('${id}','planned')">◎ Планирую</button>
                        <button class="ov-btn ov-dropped" onclick="changeStatus('${id}','dropped')">✕ Брошено</button>
                        <button class="ov-btn ov-remove"  onclick="removeItem('${id}')">— удалить</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-info">
                    <div class="card-title">${title}</div>
                    <div class="card-meta">
                        <span class="meta-year">${escapeHTML(item.year || '—')}</span>
                        <span class="meta-type">${typeL}</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="status-badge status-${item.status}">${statL}</span>
                </div>
            </div>`;
        }

        function updateStats() {
            const total   = list.length;
            const watched = list.filter(i => i.status === 'watched').length;
            const planned = list.filter(i => i.status === 'planned').length;
            const dropped = list.filter(i => i.status === 'dropped').length;
            document.getElementById('stats-row').innerHTML = `
                <span class="text-[10px] border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full opacity-40">${total} всего</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] border px-3 py-1 rounded-full" style="color:#22c55e;border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.3)">${watched} просмотрено</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full opacity-40">${planned} планирую</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] border px-3 py-1 rounded-full" style="color:#ef4444;border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.3)">${dropped} брошено</span>
            `;
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  MODAL
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        function openModal(id) {
            document.getElementById(id).classList.add('open');
            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        }
        function closeModal(id) {
            document.getElementById(id).classList.remove('open');
            document.body.style.overflow = '';
            if (id === 'modal-add') {
                document.getElementById('search-input').value = '';
                document.getElementById('search-results').innerHTML = '';
                searchCache = [];
            }
            if (id === 'modal-admin') {
                document.getElementById('admin-key-input').value = '';
                document.getElementById('admin-login-error').classList.add('hidden');
            }
        }

        // Close on overlay click
        ['modal-add', 'modal-admin'].forEach(id => {
            document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('click', e => {
                if (e.target === document.getElementById(id)) closeModal(id);
            });
        });

        document.getElementById('add-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!isAdmin()) return;
            if (!CONFIG.omdb_api_key || CONFIG.omdb_api_key === 'YOUR_OMDB_KEY') {
                document.getElementById('omdb-warn').classList.remove('hidden');
            }
            openModal('modal-add');
            setTimeout(() => document.getElementById('search-input').focus(), 120);
        });

        document.addEventListener('keydown', e => {
            if (e.key === 'Escape') {
                closeModal('modal-add');
                closeModal('modal-admin');
            }
        });

        // Modal type switch
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-type]').forEach(btn => {
            btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                modalType = btn.dataset.modalType;
                document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-type]').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
                btn.classList.add('active');
                const q = document.getElementById('search-input').value.trim();
                if (q.length >= 2) performSearch(q);
                else { document.getElementById('search-results').innerHTML = ''; searchCache = []; }
            });
        });

        // Search
        document.getElementById('search-input').addEventListener('input', e => {
            const q = e.target.value.trim();
            clearTimeout(searchTimeout);
            if (q.length < 2) {
                document.getElementById('search-results').innerHTML = '';
                searchCache = [];
                return;
            }
            searchTimeout = setTimeout(() => performSearch(q), 380);
        });

        async function performSearch(query) {
            const el = document.getElementById('search-results');
            el.innerHTML = '<div class="spinner"></div>';
            searchCache  = [];

            const result = modalType === 'anime'
                ? await searchShikimori(query)
                : await searchOMDB(query, modalType);

            if (result.error === 'no_key') {
                el.innerHTML = `<div class="warn-box">OMDB ключ не настроен.
                    Получи бесплатно: <a href="https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx" target="_blank">omdbapi.com</a>
                    → вставь в CONFIG.omdb_api_key</div>`;
                return;
            }
            if (result.error) {
                el.innerHTML = `<div class="text-[10px] opacity-35 text-center py-4">ошибка загрузки — попробуй ещё раз</div>`;
                return;
            }
            if (!result.results?.length) {
                el.innerHTML = `<div class="text-[10px] opacity-35 text-center py-4">ничего не найдено</div>`;
                return;
            }

            searchCache  = result.results;
            el.innerHTML = result.results.map((item, idx) => searchResultHTML(item, idx)).join('');
        }

        function searchResultHTML(item, idx) {
            const title = escapeHTML(item.titleRu || item.title);
            const orig  = (item.titleRu && item.title) ? escapeHTML(item.title) : '';
            return `
            <div class="search-result">
                <div class="result-poster">
                    ${item.poster
                        ? `<img src="${escapeHTML(item.poster)}" alt="${title}" loading="lazy"
                               onerror="this.parentNode.innerHTML='<div class=\\"result-no-poster\\">—</div>'">`
                        : `<div class="result-no-poster">—</div>`
                    }
                </div>
                <div class="result-info">
                    <div class="result-title">${title}</div>
                    ${orig ? `<div class="result-orig">${orig}</div>` : ''}
                    <div class="result-year">${escapeHTML(item.year)}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="result-actions">
                    <button class="add-btn add-watched" onclick="addFromCache(${idx},'watched')">✓ смотрел</button>
                    <button class="add-btn add-planned" onclick="addFromCache(${idx},'planned')">◎ планирую</button>
                    <button class="add-btn add-dropped" onclick="addFromCache(${idx},'dropped')">✕ брошено</button>
                </div>
            </div>`;
        }

        function addFromCache(idx, status) {
            const item = searchCache[idx];
            if (item) addItem(item, status);
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  FILTERS
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        document.querySelectorAll('#type-filters .filter-btn').forEach(btn => {
            btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                typeFilter = btn.dataset.type;
                document.querySelectorAll('#type-filters .filter-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
                btn.classList.add('active');
                render();
            });
        });

        document.querySelectorAll('#status-filters .filter-btn').forEach(btn => {
            btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                statusFilter = btn.dataset.status;
                document.querySelectorAll('#status-filters .filter-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
                btn.classList.add('active');
                render();
            });
        });

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  TOAST
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        let toastTimer = null;
        function showToast(msg, color) {
            const el = document.getElementById('toast');
            el.textContent    = msg;
            el.style.color    = color || '#efefef';
            el.style.borderColor = color ? `${color}22` : 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)';
            clearTimeout(toastTimer);
            el.classList.add('show');
            toastTimer = setTimeout(() => el.classList.remove('show'), 2800);
        }

        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        //  INIT
        // ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        // Restore admin session if key still in sessionStorage
        if (isAdmin()) setAdminMode(true);

        fetchList();
    </script>

    <!--
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     ИНСТРУКЦИЯ ПО НАСТРОЙКЕ (читать один раз)
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    ШАГ 1 — JSONBin.io (хранилище данных)
    ───────────────────────────────────────
    1. Зайди на https://jsonbin.io и создай бесплатный аккаунт
    2. Нажми "+ Create Bin", введи содержимое: []
    3. Убедись что "Private" = OFF (публичный бин)
    4. Нажми Create → скопируй BIN ID из адресной строки
       Пример: https://jsonbin.io/b/686abc12e41b4d34e4181234  →  ID = 686abc12e41b4d34e4181234
    5. Иди в Account → API Keys → скопируй Master Key
       Формат: $2b$10$xxxxxxxxxx...
    6. Вставь Bin ID в строку: jsonbin_bin_id: '69f0765136566621a8fe678c'

    Master Key НЕ вставляй в код — вводи его в форме входа каждую сессию.
    Это безопасно: ключ хранится только в памяти вкладки (sessionStorage),
    никуда не отправляется и исчезает при закрытии браузера.

    ШАГ 2 — OMDB API (для фильмов и сериалов)
    ───────────────────────────────────────────
    1. Зайди на https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx
    2. Выбери Free (1000 запросов/день) → введи email → подтверди
    3. Вставь ключ в строку: omdb_api_key: 'c685aa30'
    Аниме работает через Shikimori — без ключа.

    ШАГ 3 — Войти как админ
    ───────────────────────
    Нажми иконку 🔒 в правом нижнем углу → введи Master Key → Enter

    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    -->
</body>
</html>
